 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Bulk import: `POST /tickets/import` creates up to 5000 tickets, all or none.
+- Due times ([decision 9](docs/decisions/0009-due-times.md)): every ticket has a `due` (creation plus 4, 24, 72 or 168
