+### Import tickets: `POST /tickets/import`
+
+```json
+{ "tickets": [ { "title": "VPN drops every hour", "requester": "maria@example.com", "priority": "high" } ] }
+```
+
+Each item is what `POST /tickets` takes; at most 5000. The tickets are created in the given order, all or none: when an
+item is invalid nothing is created and the answer is 400, its message naming the first invalid item by its index in the
+array (`tickets[0]` is the first). Answers 201 with `{ "created": 2, "ids": ["T-0007", "T-0008"] }`. Each ticket is
+recorded and its requester notified as when it is created alone. The body may be up to 16 MiB, whatever `MAX_BODY_BYTES` is.
